@voltarenyah/dsh-prompt-note README · Where to find it：Open the right sidebar (the panel toggle at the top right), then either pick
**Pending prompts** from the empty-state list or use the sidebar's **+** (new
tab) control. The tab is per-Session: switching conversations switches the list.

@voltarenyah/dsh-prompt-note README · Route contract：All methods are `POST` with a JSON body and answer `{ ok: true, value }` or
`{ ok: false, error: { code, message } }`. The route is fenced with the Host's
browser-trust check (`connection.requestRejection`).

@voltarenyah/dsh-prompt-note README · Limits：- 20 000 characters per note, 200 notes per Session.
- The list is not pushed live to other open clients; use the reload control in
  the panel header.
